<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar committee sets unchanged molasses duties.</title>
<headline>EU sugar committee sets unchanged molasses duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday set unchanged weekly duties for molasses, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;There was little change from the previous week in the reference prices and the duty rates were unchanged,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The duty for cane molasses was fixed at the GATT maximum 0.41 Ecus per 100 kg based on a reference price of 7.65 Ecus per 100 kg compared with the previous week's figure of 7.53 Ecus.</p>
<p>The duty for beet molasses was set at zero based on a reference price of 11.43 Ecus per 100 kg compared with last week's figure of 11.21 Ecus.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
